   Berikut adalah contoh cara menggunakan `flutter_secure_storage` untuk menyimpan data:

   ```dart
   import 'package:flutter_secure_storage/flutter_secure_storage.dart';

   Future<void> main() async {
     await FlutterSecureStorage.init();
     // Menyimpan data
     await FlutterSecureStorage.put('namaData', 'isiData');
     // Membaca data
     final value = await FlutterSecureStorage.get('namaData');
     print(value);
   }
